<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal sold marks for escudos -dealers.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal sold marks for escudos -dealers.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal has sold marks for escudos at around 100.64 escudos per mark, foreign exchange dealers said on Friday.</p>
<p>The Portuguese currency was quoted at 100.59/60 to the mark at 1148 GMT.</p>
</text>
